        "patch_url": "https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/71932.patch",
        "merged_at": null
      },
      "body": "The purpose of this refactoring is to optimize concurrent hashtable for the case when the number of read operations exceeds write operations. It 10x speedups execution in case multiple reading the same element(100000000 insertions of the same item). It 5%-10% speedups test reading strings from DWARFFile. Additionally, the patch adds implementation for non-aggregate types. Also, possibility of replacing synchronization object is added.",
