      "state": "closed",
      "locked": false,
      "assignees": [

      ],
      "milestone": null,
      "comments": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-05-15T00:08:03Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-05-15T00:32:49Z",
      "closed_at": "2026-05-15T00:32:47Z",
      "assignee": null,
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "issue_field_values": [

      ],
      "type": null,
      "active_lock_reason": null,
      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/llvm/llvm-project/pulls/197847",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/197847",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/197847.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/197847.patch",
        "merged_at": "2026-05-15T00:32:47Z"
      },
      "body": "On Darwin, pthread_rwlock is faster than std::shared_mutex, which is why the implementation of llvm::sys::RWMutex used that on our platform. Everywhere else, it uses std::shared_mutex under the hood.\r\n\r\nAlso see #70151\r\n\r\nrdar://177113951",
      "reactions": {
